    m_Localized: Declare {0} as your friend?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2567876256964609
    m_Localized: Declare no friend?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2567876256964610
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2567876256964611
    m_Localized: No
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4321347998031872
    m_Localized: Cancel Ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4690287722995712
    m_Localized: ' (discarded {0})'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4690287752355840
    m_Localized: 'Discarded: {0} pts (included in declarer team total)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4690287752355841
    m_Localized: ' / needed '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4690287752355842
    m_Localized: Which cards are stronger?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4690287752355843
    m_Localized: 'Basic order: Mighty > Joker > trump > the led suit


      Within
      the same suit: A > K > Q > J > 10 > 9 > ... > 2. A non-trump card of another
      suit cannot beat the led suit, even with a higher rank.


      Hearts are
      trump this round. The Mighty is always strongest. The Joker loses its power
      on the first and last tricks and when a Joker Call is active.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6909019002216448
    m_Localized: Join Room
    m_Metadata:
