  - m_Id: 6909462298206208
    m_Localized: Confirm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7134920700829696
    m_Localized: 'Before we begin: four key terms'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7134920772132864
    m_Localized: 'Declarer: The winner of the bidding. They set the trump suit and
      target score, then choose a friend.


      Friend: The declarer''s teammate.
      When a card is named, its holder is the friend; playing that card reveals their
      identity.


      Mighty: The strongest card. Usually the ace of spades; when
      spades are trump, it is the ace of diamonds.


      Trump: The strongest suit
      for this round. It beats other suits except the mighty and joker. No-trump
      has no trump suit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7134920772132865
    m_Localized: 'You have a strong hand with many hearts. Now become the declarer
      and choose your team''s target score and trump suit.


      Select 13 points
      and hearts, then submit your bid. All bots will pass in this practice.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7134920772132866
    m_Localized: 'The declarer is a bot, with a bid of 13 points and hearts as trump.


      The
      declarer named the ace of spades as the friend card. You hold it, so you are
      on the same team. Playing it reveals your identity to everyone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043226742784
    m_Localized: "1 / 2 \xB7 Try playing"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714304
    m_Localized: "The 10 face-up cards at the bottom are your hand. The other four
      players\u2019 hands are face down.\n\nLet\u2019s learn the rules by playing
      cards. Read each explanation and press Confirm to continue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714305
    m_Localized: Follow the first suit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714306
    m_Localized: "The lead player started this trick with \u2663A. If you have the
      same suit as the first card, ordinary cards must follow that suit.\n\nOnce
      there are at least two cards on the table, a yellow border marks the strongest
      card so far.\n\nPlay \u26632 this time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714307
    m_Localized: "Play \u26632 to follow clubs."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714308
    m_Localized: Ace is highest in the same suit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714309
    m_Localized: "Everyone played clubs, so \u2663A won.\n\nWithin a suit, cards
      rank A > K > Q > J > 10 > 9 > \u2026 > 2. The trick winner leads the next trick."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714310
    m_Localized: "Trump \xB7 the strongest suit"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714311
    m_Localized: "Trump is the strongest suit for this round. Hearts are trump this
      round. You can check trump in the round information at the top.\n\nThis trick
      started with \u2666K, but you have no diamonds. Without the lead suit, you
      may play another suit. Try \u26654."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714312
    m_Localized: "You have no diamonds. Play the trump card \u26654."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714313
    m_Localized: "\u26654 overtook \u2666K"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714314
    m_Localized: "\u26654 is lower in rank than \u2666K, but hearts are trump, so
      \u26654 is stronger. The yellow border moved to \u26654.\n\nOne player still
      has a card to play. Press Confirm to see it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714315
    m_Localized: Higher trump wins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714316
    m_Localized: "The last bot played \u26656. Higher ranks win within the trump
      suit, so \u26656 won.\n\nThat bot will lead the next trick."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714317
    m_Localized: Mighty and Joker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714318
    m_Localized: "Mighty is always the strongest card. It is usually \u2660A, but
      becomes \u2666A when spades are trump.\n\nJoker is usually second to Mighty.
      Mighty and Joker do not have to follow the first suit.\n\nHearts are trump
      this round, so \u2660A is Mighty."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714319
    m_Localized: Play Mighty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714320
    m_Localized: "The bot led clubs. Even though you have clubs, Mighty is an exception
      and may be played.\n\nPlay \u2660A to see the strongest card in action."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714321
    m_Localized: "Play \u2660A, this round\u2019s Mighty."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714322
    m_Localized: "Friend revealed \xB7 Mighty saved the team"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714323
    m_Localized: "The last bot played \u2660A, Mighty! Mighty beat \u2665K and collected
      3 point cards.\n\nThat bot is the Mighty friend you chose. Playing \u2660A
      reveals their identity and shows a purple friend badge. Their points now count
      toward the declarer\u2019s team.\n\nThis is how a hidden friend helps the declarer.
      Now play three more tricks using your own judgment."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714324
    m_Localized: "A\xB7K\xB7Q\xB7J\xB710 are point cards"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714325
    m_Localized: "Look at the five cards on the table. Each A, K, Q, J and 10 is
      worth 1 point, making 20 points in a full round.\n\nYou earned 4 points from
      \u2660A, \u2663K, \u2663Q and \u2663J.\n\nPress Confirm to collect the point
      cards and clear the other cards."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714326
    m_Localized: Lead with a Joker Call!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714327
    m_Localized: "You won the previous trick, so you lead. This round\u2019s Joker
      Call card is \u26633.\n\nJoker is second to Mighty, but loses its power when
      drawn out by a Joker Call. Calling when you lead forces the opponent holding
      Joker to play it.\n\nSelect \u26633, then choose \u201CUse Joker Call\u201D."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714328
    m_Localized: "\u26633 \u2192 \u201CUse Joker Call\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714329
    m_Localized: You drew out the Joker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714330
    m_Localized: "The Joker drawn out by the call lost its power. \u266310, the highest
      club in this trick, won.\n\nJoker also loses its power on the first and last
      tricks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714331
    m_Localized: First practice recap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714332
    m_Localized: "Basic strength: Mighty > Joker > trump > lead suit\nWithin a suit:
      A > K > Q > J > 10 > \u2026 > 2\n\nOrdinary cards must follow suit; Mighty
      and Joker are exceptions. Joker loses its power on the first and last tricks
      and when called.\n\nCollect A, K, Q, J and 10 for points. Now let\u2019s move
      to the second practice round."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714333
    m_Localized: "2 / 2 \xB7 Bid to become declarer"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714334
    m_Localized: 'Before play, players compete to become declarer by proposing a
      trump suit and a target score. This is a bid.


      You have a strong hand
      with many hearts. Choose 13 points and hearts, then submit your bid. The bots
      will all pass.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714335
    m_Localized: Bid 13 points with hearts as trump.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714336
    m_Localized: You became declarer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714337
    m_Localized: 'All the bots passed, so you became declarer.


      Your team
      must collect at least 13 points with hearts as trump. Press Confirm to pick
      up the three kitty cards.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714338
    m_Localized: Exchange the three kitty cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714339
    m_Localized: "You received three kitty cards and now have 13 cards. Discard three
      to return to 10.\n\nSelect \u26602, \u26662 and \u26632, then press \u201CDiscard
      3\u201D. Click a selected card again to deselect it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714340
    m_Localized: "Select \u26602, \u26662 and \u26632 \u2192 \u201CDiscard 3\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714341
    m_Localized: Your hand is ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714342
    m_Localized: "After discarding three cards, you have 10 again. The kitty lets
      the declarer improve their hand.\n\nDiscarded point cards count toward the
      declarer team\u2019s score. None of your three discards were point cards."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714343
    m_Localized: Choose your friend
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714344
    m_Localized: "The declarer can name a card and make its holder their friend.\n\nCall
      the holder of Mighty, a card you do not have, onto your team. Choose \u201CMighty\u201D."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714345
    m_Localized: "Choose \u201CMighty\u201D to declare your friend."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714346
    m_Localized: "Mighty\u2019s holder is on your team"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714347
    m_Localized: "The player holding \u2660A became your friend. Even the declarer
      does not know who it is until that player plays \u2660A.\n\nChoosing a player
      directly reveals the friend immediately. No Friend means taking on the declarer
      role alone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714348
    m_Localized: "The declarer\u2019s first card"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714349
    m_Localized: "The declarer leads the first trick. Hearts are trump in this round.\n\nPlay
      \u2665A, the highest heart, to begin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714350
    m_Localized: "Play \u2665A to start the first trick."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714351
    m_Localized: "You won the first trick with \u2665A"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714352
    m_Localized: "Everyone played hearts, so the highest heart, \u2665A, won.\n\nYou
      still hold strong trumps such as \u2665Q, \u2665J and \u266510, but no \u2665K.
      You also do not know who your friend is yet. Let\u2019s play the next trick."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714353
    m_Localized: Choose your own cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714354
    m_Localized: 'Use what you learned to choose a card. Every legal card is allowed.


      After
      each trick, we will look at what actually happened.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714355
    m_Localized: Choose any card you can legally play.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714356
    m_Localized: Practice complete!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714357
    m_Localized: 'Congratulations! You tried following suit, trump, Mighty and friend,
      point cards and Joker Call.


      You also practiced bidding, exchanging
      the kitty and choosing a friend as declarer, followed by three free-play tricks.


      A
      real round has 10 tricks. The declarer team wins by reaching its target; defenders
      win by preventing that. Keep practicing in single player!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714358
    m_Localized: Start single player
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714359
    m_Localized: Mighty tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714360
    m_Localized: 'Mighty is a five-player game where two teams collect point cards.


      Each
      player plays one card. Whoever plays the strongest card takes all five cards.
      This is one trick.


      Learn the rules by playing two short practice rounds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714361
    m_Localized: Trick result
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714362
    m_Localized: Mighty was played and beat all other cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714363
    m_Localized: Joker had its power in this trick and won.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714364
    m_Localized: Trump beat the first suit and won.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714365
    m_Localized: The highest card of the same suit won.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714366
    m_Localized: You chose a legal card yourself. The trick winner leads the next
      trick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714367
    m_Localized: "Mighty does not have to follow suit. This lesson practices following
      suit with ordinary cards, so try \u26632."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714368
    m_Localized: "\u26633 is legal too, but save it for the Joker Call lesson. Play
      \u26632 this time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714369
    m_Localized: "The first card is a club. You have clubs, so ordinary cards must
      follow clubs. Try \u26632."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714370
    m_Localized: "This lesson shows the power of trump. You have no diamonds, so
      you can play \u26654."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714371
    m_Localized: "This lesson practices Mighty, the strongest card. Try \u2660A."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714372
    m_Localized: "This lesson practices Joker Call. Select \u26633 and choose \u201CUse
      Joker Call\u201D."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714373
    m_Localized: Practice becoming declarer with a heart-heavy hand. Bid 13 points
      with hearts as trump.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714374
    m_Localized: "Discard three cards to return to 10. Select \u26602, \u26662 and
      \u26632 this time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714375
    m_Localized: "This lesson calls the Mighty holder as friend. Choose \u201CMighty\u201D."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714376
    m_Localized: "The declarer leads the first trick. Play \u2665A, the highest heart,
      this time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714377
    m_Localized: Follow the current lesson instructions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714378
    m_Localized: You have the first suit, so you cannot play an ordinary card of
      another suit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714379
    m_Localized: Joker Call is active, so you must play Joker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714380
    m_Localized: Free play 1 / 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714381
    m_Localized: Free play 2 / 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714382
    m_Localized: Free play 3 / 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714383
    m_Localized: You won this trick and collected 0 point cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714384
    m_Localized: A bot won this trick and collected 0 point cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714385
    m_Localized: You won this trick and collected 1 point cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714386
    m_Localized: A bot won this trick and collected 1 point cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714387
    m_Localized: You won this trick and collected 2 point cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714388
    m_Localized: A bot won this trick and collected 2 point cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714389
    m_Localized: You won this trick and collected 3 point cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714390
    m_Localized: A bot won this trick and collected 3 point cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714391
    m_Localized: You won this trick and collected 4 point cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714392
    m_Localized: A bot won this trick and collected 4 point cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714393
    m_Localized: You won this trick and collected 5 point cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7262043247714394
    m_Localized: A bot won this trick and collected 5 point cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7630984121917440
    m_Localized: Win a trick with Mighty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7630984168054784
    m_Localized: "\u2660A is the strongest card, so you won this trick."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7630984168054785
    m_Localized: Minimize
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7630984168054786
    m_Localized: Expand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7630984168054787
    m_Localized: The trick winner leads the next trick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7647835623235584
    m_Localized: Mighty has three roles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7647835648401408
    m_Localized: 'The three roles in Mighty are declarer, friend and citizen.


      The
      declarer leads the game, elected by bidding a target score. Use a strong hand
      and work with your friend to reach that target and win.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7647835648401409
    m_Localized: "Friend \xB7 a hidden teammate"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7647835648401410
    m_Localized: "The friend is a hidden member of the declarer\u2019s team, chosen
      by the declarer. Until the friend card (such as Mighty) is played, their identity
      stays hidden from all other players, including the declarer.\n\nThe friend
      knows their own role and helps the declarer while hidden among the citizens.
      When revealed, all their points, including earlier points, count toward the
      declarer\u2019s team. They win together by reaching the target."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7647835648401411
    m_Localized: "Citizens \xB7 stop the declarer\u2019s team"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7647835648401412
    m_Localized: "The citizens are the other three players, excluding the declarer
      and friend.\n\nCollect point cards to prevent the declarer\u2019s team (declarer
      + friend) from reaching its target. The game also calls citizens the defending
      team.\n\nIn this practice round, become the declarer and play alongside a hidden
      friend."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7647835648401413
    m_Localized: "Lead the next trick with \u2665Q"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7647835648401414
    m_Localized: "You won the previous trick, so you lead again.\n\nPlay \u2665Q.
      Another player holds \u2665K, which is stronger than \u2665Q."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7647835648401415
    m_Localized: "Play \u2665Q to start the next trick."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7647835648401416
    m_Localized: "A citizen\u2019s \u2665K is winning"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7647835648401417
    m_Localized: "A citizen played \u2665K, beating your \u2665Q. If the trick ended
      now, the citizens would take the points.\n\nThe last player has not played
      yet. Press Confirm to see their card."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7647835648401418
    m_Localized: Preparing the first practice round...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7647835648401419
    m_Localized: Preparing the second practice round...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7647835648401420
    m_Localized: "Play \u2665Q to see how your hidden friend helps you."
